{
  "prompt": "Create a low-angle luxury eyewear editorial campaign photograph using the input talent as the subject reference and the input Persol eyewear image as the product reference. Preserve the exact identity, facial structure, hairstyle, proportions, and recognizable traits of the reference talent. The talent is holding the referenced Persol eyeglasses very close to the camera, with exaggerated perspective so that the hand and the eyewear dominate the foreground. Reproduce the eyewear exactly from the product reference, including the soft-square frame silhouette, thick sculpted acetate construction, translucent olive-smoky frame color, blue-grey lenses, prominent bridge structure, visible central leather nose detail, refined metallic signature accents, material finish, proportions, and branding language, with no redesign or distortion. The full body of the talent remains visible in the background with a wide stance and dynamic but elegant posture. Clean pure white studio background, high-key studio lighting, razor-sharp primary focus on the eyewear, slight depth of field on the talent, sophisticated contemporary outfit with strong contrast tones, premium Italian luxury eyewear advertising aesthetic, ultra-clean composition, crisp grounded shadows, refined commercial studio photography."
}

